# User Manual — eSmartLib RHSTI

## A. Students
**Register / Login**
1. Open the site → *Login*. New students use *Register* (Student ID, name, grade/section, password). Accounts created by the library use the Student ID as the first password.
2. Too many wrong attempts lock the account for a few minutes.

**Dashboard**
- View borrowed books and due dates.
- **Request a book:** choose an available book, add a message, send. Track the status (pending / approved / declined). Approved books are held for you; borrow by showing your QR to the librarian. You may cancel to release the hold.
- **Profile photo:** JPG/PNG/WebP up to 8 MB.
- **Change password** from the dashboard.
- **Chat:** *Chat → New chat*, search a name or ID.
- **Forgot password:** use *Forgot password*, then ask the admin for the 6-digit code (valid 10 minutes).

## B. Librarian / Admin
- **Books:** *Books → Add* (accession no., title, author, publisher, category, quantity). Print book QR (`BK:<accession>`).
- **Students:** add manually or *Import CSV* (download the template first). Print student QR (`STU:<student_no>`). Open a student to edit or deactivate (admin).
- **Borrow:** keep the scan box focused → scan student QR → scan book QR → confirm. Due date is automatic.
- **Return:** scan the book QR.
- **Attendance:** scan student QR; first scan = Time-In, next = Time-Out.
- **History:** filter Borrow / Return / Attendance, search, print.
- **Admin only — Account & Requests:** Profile (change password) · Settings (library/school name, max loans, loan days) · Password resets (verify identity, generate code, give it to the user) · Book requests (reply, approve/decline). A red dot shows pending items.

## C. Install as an app
Android Chrome: menu → *Install app*. iPhone Safari: Share → *Add to Home Screen*.

## Troubleshooting
| Problem | Fix |
|---|---|
| Camera does not scan | Use HTTPS/localhost and allow camera permission |
| QR not recognized | Check the format `STU:` / `BK:` and that the record exists |
| "Student account is inactive" | Admin reactivates the student |
| Cannot connect to database | See Technical Manual |
